    "ownership_history": [],
    "metadata": {
      "type": "landmark",
      "description": "A massive, mysterious continent covered in dense jungle, infested with deadly diseases like green fever and red death, and home to hostile wildlife. Westerosi maesters have only mapped its northern shorelines.",
      "narratorText": "Sothoryos — a green hell of plague, monsters, and wild brindled men. The Valyrian dragonlord Jaenara Belaerys flew her dragon Terrax south over the continent for three years and found only endless jungle, declaring Sothoryos to be as large as Essos, a land without end."
    },
    "coordinates": {
      "x": 801.8,
      "y": 911.3
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "zamettar",
