    "metadata": {
      "type": "landmark",
      "description": "A ruined penal colony established by the Old Ghiscari on the rocky shores of Wyvern Point. It was eventually abandoned to the wildlife and elements.",
      "narratorText": "Gorosh was built of cold stone on the cliffs of Wyvern Point. The prisoners sent here did not have to worry about execution — the yellow plagues and the wyverns that hunt the skies did the work for their masters."
    }
  },
  {
