    "ownership_history": [],
    "metadata": {
      "type": "landmark",
      "description": "An ancient, vast, and wealthy empire in the far east of Essos, ruled by the God-Emperor. Renowned for its silk, jade, and massive cities. In Westeros, it is seen as a land of legends.",
      "narratorText": "Yi Ti is an empire of ten thousand gods and a hundred dynasties. While Westerosi kings fought in mud and timber, the God-Emperors of Yin built palaces of jade and gold that cover entire hillsides. Yet behind its splendor lies the shadow of the Grey Waste."
    }
  },
