      "description": "The ancient and sprawling capital city of the Golden Empire of Yi Ti. A massive port on the Jade Sea, housing the immense palace complex of the God-Emperor.",
      "narratorText": "Yin is a city of gold and jade, larger than King's Landing and Oldtown combined. The palace of the God-Emperor is so grand that a horseman could ride through its corridors for a day and never see the same hall twice."
