    "metadata": {
      "type": "landmark",
      "description": "A vast, densely forested landmass at the very edge of the known world. Separated from the Shadow Lands by the Saffron Straits. Its size, population, and geography remain completely unknown.",
      "narratorText": "Ulthos is a shadow on the edge of maps. Westerosi sailors only see its dark, jungle-choked coastlines across the Saffron Straits. None have traveled inland and returned, and the maesters debate whether it is a continent or a massive island."
    },
    "coordinates": {
